    "body": "## PR #660 二次审计证据回收（来自 #665）\n\n#665 属于本 issue 已定义的 Failed / Cancelled 终态分类。审计后需要缩窄表述：进度条件失败已经走 `Failed`，仍错误的是标签阻止和激活前置校验两条早期路径。\n\n- 标签要求缺失或命中阻止标签时调用 `CancelCurrent`：[`AbilityExecSystem.cs#L247-L280`](https://github.com/MightyBubble/Ludots/blob/d45aa049ddea7ce5cb676875c318e6f6a65873f4/src/Core/Gameplay/GAS/Systems/AbilityExecSystem.cs#L247-L280)。\n- 激活前置校验失败时同样调用 `CancelCurrent`：[`AbilityExecSystem.cs#L349-L381`](https://github.com/MightyBubble/Ludots/blob/d45aa049ddea7ce5cb676875c318e6f6a65873f4/src/Core/Gameplay/GAS/Systems/AbilityExecSystem.cs#L349-L381)。\n- `CancelCurrent` 固定发布 `OrderTerminalState.Cancelled`：[`OrderSubmitter.cs#L338-L340`](https://github.com/MightyBubble/Ludots/blob/d45aa049ddea7ce5cb676875c318e6f6a65873f4/src/Core/Gameplay/GAS/Orders/OrderSubmitter.cs#L338-L340)。\n- 现有测试 `AbilityExecSystem_ActivationPreconditionGraphRejectsCast_AndCancelsOrder` 只检查订单被清除和表现层 `CastFailed`，没有断言终态，测试名称还固化了错误的 Cancelled 语义。\n\n新增验收：\n\n- [ ] RequiredAll 缺失和 BlockedAny 命中发布 `Failed / ActivationBlocked`。\n- [ ] 激活前置校验失败发布 `Failed / PreconditionFailed`。\n- [ ] 主动取消和新订单打断继续使用 `Cancelled`，且原因可区分。\n- [ ] 修改现有测试，使其断言唯一终态及失败原因，而不是只检查 active order 被清除。\n\n#665 将作为重复审计票关闭。\n",
